{"recordId":"general_盛庸_306419188","name":"盛庸","type":"general","dynasty":"明朝","title":"南軍柱石","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"盛庸","pageId":394042,"revisionId":93642775,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-07-25T12:06:57Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9B%9B%E5%BA%B8","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93642775","wikidataId":"Q11581421","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"龍溪盛氏宗譜","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明通鉴","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明太宗实录","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明鉴纲目","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"革除逸史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"明史/卷144","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7144","origin":"sister-template","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:02.264Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:mingshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:mingshi-6ff51c029f915f39","query":"盛庸","count":11,"offset":1739,"excerpt":"國同心，掃茲逆氛，永安至治。\n\n　　尋命安陸侯吳傑，江陰侯吳高，都督耿瓛，都指揮盛庸、潘忠、楊松、顧成、徐凱、李友、陳暉、平安，分道並進。置平燕布政使司於真定，尚書暴昭掌司事。\n\n　　八月己酉，耿炳文兵次真定，徐凱屯河間，潘忠、楊松屯鄚州。壬子","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-0882414d996367cb","query":"盛庸","count":8,"offset":1831,"excerpt":"德州。\n\n　　五月癸酉，王入德州，景隆走濟南。庚辰，攻濟南，敗景隆軍城下。鐵鉉、盛庸堅守，不克。\n\n　　秋八月戊申，解圍還北平。\n\n　　九月，盛庸代李景隆將，復取德州，與吳傑、平安、徐凱相掎角，以困北平。時徐凱方城滄州，王佯出兵攻遼東，至通州，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-f8770ff89300a860","query":"盛庸","count":1,"offset":713,"excerpt":"未，命寶源局鑄農器，給山東被兵窮民。庚寅，初遣中官馬彬使爪哇諸國。乙未，奪歷城侯盛庸爵，尋自殺。庚子，岷王楩有罪，削其護衞。\n\n　　冬十一月乙亥朔，頒曆於朝鮮諸國，著為令。壬辰，罷遣浚河民夫。甲午，北京地震。乙未，命六科辦事官言事。丙申，韓觀討","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-795b188b539558ce","query":"盛庸","count":1,"offset":12967,"excerpt":"|| 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　\n\n歷城侯\n盛庸 \n建文中以伐燕封。永樂元年除。 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　 || 　\n\n右建","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-c726ae3494188ab1","query":"盛庸","count":4,"offset":805,"excerpt":"謝燕，而陰留之京師，仍參密議。景隆遺燕王書，言二人已竄，可息兵。燕王不聽。明年，盛庸捷東昌，帝告廟，命二人任職如故。及夾河之敗，復解二人官求罷兵，燕王曰：「此緩我也。」進益急。\n\n始削藩議起，帝入泰、子澄言，謂以天下制一隅甚易。及屢敗，意中悔，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-bfd79d8b71911cc8","query":"盛庸","count":5,"offset":426,"excerpt":"景隆兵敗白溝河，單騎走德州，城戍皆望風潰。鉉與參軍高巍感奮涕泣，自臨邑趨濟南，偕盛庸、宋參軍等誓以死守。燕兵攻德州，景隆走依鉉。德州陷，燕兵收其儲蓄百餘萬，勢益張。遂攻濟南，景隆復大敗，南奔。鉉與庸等乘城守禦。燕兵堤水灌城，築長圍，晝夜攻擊。鉉","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-ec8ddeb3a2f04ba6","query":"盛庸","count":6,"offset":18,"excerpt":"〔篇題：卷一百四十四\n列傳第三十二　盛庸 平安 何福 顧成〕\n\n○盛庸平安何福顧成\n\n盛庸，不知何許人。洪武中，累官至都指揮。建文初，以參將從耿炳文伐燕。李景隆代炳文，遂隸景隆麾下。二年四月，景隆敗於","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-3233894f7cd2e90d","query":"盛庸","count":5,"offset":703,"excerpt":"」乃還。復攻東昌，戰敗，亡大將張玉，復還。成祖意欲稍休，道衍力趣之。益募勇士，敗盛庸，破房昭西水寨。道衍語成祖：「毋下城邑，疾趨京師。京師單弱，勢必舉。」從之。遂連敗諸將於淝河、靈璧，渡江入京師。\n\n成祖即帝位，授道衍僧錄司左善世。帝在藩邸，所","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-409458940efca294","query":"盛庸","count":1,"offset":4939,"excerpt":"指揮僉事。旭嗣官，為會州衛指揮同知，舉城降燕。從徇灤河，功多。力戰真定。守德州，盛庸兵至，棄城走。置不問。從入京師，封雲陽伯，祿千石。永樂元年，命巡視中都及直隸衛所軍馬城池。四年從英國公張輔征交阯，為右參將。偕豐城侯李彬破西都。師還，與彬各加祿","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-41673da3227890bd","query":"盛庸","count":1,"offset":1227,"excerpt":"同，為先鋒。戰白溝河，追奔至濟南，遷指揮使。戰東昌，以五十騎敗南兵數百。時成祖為盛庸所敗，還走北平。庸檄真定諸將屯威縣、深州，邀燕歸路。祿皆擊走之。戰滹沱河，右軍卻。祿馳赴陣，出入數十戰，破之。追奔至夾河，斬馘無算。戰單家橋，為平安所執。奮脫縛","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-ca3c0750c8bc636c","query":"盛庸","count":1,"offset":2794,"excerpt":"名。」於是諸忠臣無遺種矣。\n\n　　永樂元年擢左都御史，益以訐發為能。八月劾曆城侯盛庸怨誹，當誅，庸自殺。二年劾曹國公李景隆謀不軌，又劾景隆弟增枝知景隆不臣不諫，多置莊產，蓄佃僕，意叵測，俱收系。又劾長興侯耿炳文僭，炳文自殺。劾駙馬都尉梅殷邪謀，","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":11,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:mingshi-6ff51c029f915f39","bookId":"book:mingshi","requestedTitle":"明史/卷4","title":"明史/卷4","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B74","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594634","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B74?action=history","revisionId":2594634,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-30T13:20:43Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:58:10.667Z","sha256":"2dee7ca3ee519c6dabc48dca2414011ada1f5d202c464349adb3416d0d7407ef","textSha256":"1834bbf34d8a77b3279636a7437bce88687e65cb6c2346a97c1f4a98c52aca4e","expandedWikitextSha256":"2dee7ca3ee519c6dabc48dca2414011ada1f5d202c464349adb3416d0d7407ef","characters":4507,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:44.927Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/34446af0c9e206b2ab3